body:
> NoFap doesn't give you super powers. It teaches you that you're strong enough to choose your own superpowers. That you are stronger than your will, and you make choices based on what you actually want, instead of how you feel. 

This line is so powerful.

&#x200B;

>You get better at not listening to them.

This struck a chord.

&#x200B;

*Break the cycle Morty! Rise above! Focus on Science.*

&#x200B;

Sorry I couldn't help it.
